## Referencia Rapida de Caminhos
- Componentes Vue: resources/js/Components/UI/Zy*.vue
- Paginas: resources/js/Pages/{Domain}/*.vue
- Layouts: resources/js/Layouts/*.vue
- Types: resources/js/Types/*.ts
- Composables: resources/js/Composables/use*.ts
- Controllers: app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/
- Services: app/Domains/{Domain}/Services/
- Models: app/Domains/{Domain}/Models/
- Migrations: database/migrations/
- Tests: tests/Feature/ e tests/Unit/
